# This repository is routinely checked out on /mnt/c under WSL, where
# Windows-side tools can rewrite files with CRLF endings between a commit
# and the next `git add`. On 2026-09-10 that silently turned seven
# untouched files into whole-file rewrites in a branch diff; the commit was
# rebuilt before it reached main. Normalizing here means git stores LF and
# checks out LF regardless of what rewrote the working tree, so a stray CRLF
# pass produces no diff instead of a 500-line one.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep the checker's own fixtures byte-exact if any are ever added.
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
